<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <LangVersion>14</LangVersion>
    <ImplicitUsings>disable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0;net8.0;net9.0;netstandard2.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <Title>DotExtensions</Title>
    <Authors>Alastair Lundy</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) Alastair Lundy 2020-2026</Copyright>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/alastairlundy/DotExtensions</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>extensions, extension-members,extension-methods, ienumerable-extensions,</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
#### 🐛 Bug Fixes

**I/O**
- Fixed file size formatting at exact 1000-multiple boundaries
- Fixed Unix permission notation parsing and stopped counting Deny ACL entries as grants
- Safely enumeration now includes hidden and system entries and caps recursion depth
- Aligned Safely enumeration case-sensitivity defaults and returning an empty result for missing directories instead of throwing
- `GetRandomDrive` now deep-walks candidate drives before declaring that none contain files
- Guarded drive `HasFiles`/`HasDirectories` against not-ready drives
- Fixed Linux fallbacks in `GetRandomDirectory` and `DrivesIsEmpty`
- Fixed a stale `homeTokenIndex` when a PATH entry contains both `~` and `$HOME`

**Numbers**
- Fixed digit counting for floating point values and infinite generic numeric types
- Fixed from-end `Index.AsRange` handling, empty incremented-range validation, and truncating behavior in `ToDestinationNumber`

**Strings**
- Fixed `StringSegment` `Remove` off-by-one errors and a `Contains` throw near the end of the segment
- Fixed `InsertRange` argument binding and inverted `Remove`-range validation
- `Insert`/`InsertRange` now accept an append position index equal to `Length`
- `ReplaceFirst`/`ReplaceLast` now accept an empty replacement value and null-check the receiver
- Escape character removal is now single-pass and no longer trims edge spaces

**Threading &amp; Security**
- Fixed `WaitAsync` timeout blocking behavior
- Fixed `SecureString` validation and wipe bugs

**Dates &amp; Versions**
- `DateOnly` conversion and week / day-of-week calculations are now culture-safe
- Fixed inverted XML docs on `Version` comparison predicates
</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Description>A collection of useful extension members and extension methods for .NET .</Description>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageId>DotExtensions</PackageId>
      <IsTrimmable>true</IsTrimmable>
    <EnableTrimAnalyzer>true</EnableTrimAnalyzer>
    <TrimmerSingleWarn>false</TrimmerSingleWarn>
      <PolyArgumentExceptions>true</PolyArgumentExceptions>
      <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS0618</NoWarn>
      <Version>10.6.2</Version>
      <AssemblyVersion>10.6.2</AssemblyVersion>
      <FileVersion>10.6.2</FileVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

    <PropertyGroup Condition="$(TargetFramework) != 'netstandard2.0' OR $(TargetFramework) == 'netstandard2.1'">
        <IsAoTCompatible>true</IsAoTCompatible>
        <EnableAotAnalyzer>true</EnableAotAnalyzer>
    </PropertyGroup>
    
    <ItemGroup Condition="$(TargetFramework) == 'netstandard2.0'">
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Bcl.Memory"  />
        <PackageReference Include="System.IO.FileSystem.AccessControl"/>
    </ItemGroup>
    
    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives" />
        <PackageReference Include="Polyfill" PrivateAssets="all"/>
        <PackageReference Include="Meziantou.Analyzer" PrivateAssets="all"/>
    </ItemGroup>
    
    <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Update="Internal\Localizations\Resources.Designer.cs">
      <DesignTime>True</DesignTime>
      <AutoGen>True</AutoGen>
      <DependentUpon>Resources.resx</DependentUpon>
    </Compile>
  </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="DotExtensions.Benchmarking"/>
    </ItemGroup>
    
  <ItemGroup>
    <EmbeddedResource Update="Internal\Localizations\Resources.resx">
      <Generator>ResXFileCodeGenerator</Generator>
      <LastGenOutput>Resources.Designer.cs</LastGenOutput>
    </EmbeddedResource>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="..\README.md">
      <Link>README.md</Link>
      <PackagePath>README.md</PackagePath>
    </Content>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Folder Include="System\" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
